{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The 2ES4K is a twin-section DC electric locomotive (3 kV) designed for hauling heavy freight trains on mainline routes.<br>Each section is equipped with asynchronous traction motors, a microprocessor control system, and modern diagnostic tools. The locomotive provides smooth acceleration, efficient regenerative braking, and high operational economy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In ZDSimulator, it is presented in the livery used in Kazakhstan, where such locomotives operate on long-distance freight lines. This version adds more variety and allows players to experience the atmosphere of Kazakh railways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Main specifications:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Current type: DC, 3 kV</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maximum speed: up to 120 km/h</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Continuous power: 8 800 kW</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Axle arrangement: Bo\u2032Bo\u2032 + Bo\u2032Bo\u2032</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weight: \u2248 192 t</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starting tractive effort: up to 650 kN</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3614810?t=1762292942","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614810/9ed43b45de0d5109efeb07a485d7bfd4ae5d1ebe/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762292942","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614810/e0a37c8011d7a9919a435bc3a344b8c7ce753153/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762292942","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614810/e0a37c8011d7a9919a435bc3a344b8c7ce753153/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762292942","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The 2ES4K is a twin-section DC electric locomotive (3 kV) designed for hauling heavy freight trains on mainline routes.<br>Each section is equipped with asynchronous traction motors, a microprocessor control system, and modern diagnostic tools. The locomotive provides smooth acceleration, efficient regenerative braking, and high operational economy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In ZDSimulator, it is presented in the livery used in Kazakhstan, where such locomotives operate on long-distance freight lines. This version adds more variety and allows players to experience the atmosphere of Kazakh railways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Main specifications:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Current type: DC, 3 kV</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maximum speed: up to 120 km/h</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Continuous power: 8 800 kW</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Axle arrangement: Bo\u2032Bo\u2032 + Bo\u2032Bo\u2032</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weight: \u2248 192 t</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starting tractive effort: up to 650 kN</p></li></ul>","developers":["ZDSimulator Team"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3381120","name":"ZDSimulator"},"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614810/7d4d593b337c74c004e873b010f5d6db8dabf9d6/header.jpg?t=1762292942","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"ZDSimulator - 2ES4k Locomotive","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":[],"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["ZDSimulator Team"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"0","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","us